      "content": "i get that, but i'm just so broke right now and a doctor visit is gonna cost me like a whole week of groceries. if i really wanted to be careful about it, like if i used a brand new needle from a sterile pack and cleaned the whole area with betadine or something heavy duty, would that make it safe enough to do at home? i just want to get the pressure out so i can sleep.",
